full-query: "Your application has an Auto Scaling group of three EC2 instances behind an Elastic Load Balancer. Your Auto Scaling group was updated with a new launch configuration that refers to an updated AMI. During the deployment, customers complained that they were receiving several errors even though all instances passed the ELB health checks. How can you prevent this from happening again?"
